<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2127" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴγειρος</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>black poplar, Populus nigra</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μακεδνή, μακρή</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				7.106
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				10.510
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.482
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				23
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴ. ύδατοτρεφέες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					17.208
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				9.141
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.64
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				239
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				210
			</span></i> (lyr); named among <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄκαρπα</span>
			in <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				401a4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρποφόρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Mir.</u>
					835b2
				</span></i>
			: prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰγείρου θέα</span>, of a
			seat in the theatre which had no view of the stage, <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				339
			</span></i>.</div>
